    <string-array name="whats_new_items">
        <item>Live view more compact on phones, portrait and landscape: buttons on one row, slim navigation, more species visible</item>
        <item>Listen to a detection right on the species card (Play); a second tap stops, a new one stops the old one</item>
        <item>Microphone is muted while playing through the speaker (no self-detection); stays on with headphones</item>
        <item>Species detected again: the card flashes briefly</item>
        <item>Confirm/reject without popup, undo right on the card</item>
        <item>Spectrogram: time window up to 30 s, recalculated immediately after switching tabs, much less battery with the screen on; settings as tiles</item>
        <item>Analysis: species detected several times can be expanded, connected calls can be played as one episode</item>
        <item>Select several recordings (long press), move or delete them</item>
        <item>Map: tap a point to move or listen to it; location button shows a 200 m view</item>
        <item>New app icon, smaller installation file</item>
    </string-array>
